uring the past week? (Moderate","bbox":[91.0395,203.6655,533.66852,214.6655],"origin":[91.0395,212.16498],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"urge)","bbox":[91.0395,215.76547,116.71349,226.76547],"origin":[91.0395,224.26495],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"- 3. During the past week how much time have you spent thinking about drinking or bout how","bbox":[91.0395,227.86545,541.64355,238.86545],"origin":[91.0395,236.36493],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"good a drink would make you feel? (46 to 90 minutes)","bbox":[91.0395,239.96542,352.71848,250.96542],"origin":[91.0395,248.4649],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Scoring and Interpretation Information","bbox":[34.3465,269.25595,290.26645,283.25595],"origin":[34.3465,280.06219],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"For comprehensive information on the PACS, ","bbox":[91.03939,288.49973,315.4064,299.49973],"origin":[91.03939,296.99921],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"see here","bbox":[315.40601,288.50052,358.207,299.50052],"origin":[315.40601,297.0],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#0000ff","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":".","bbox":[358.207,288.50052,361.26501,299.50052],"origin":[358.207,297.0],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"### PACS Scoring","bbox":[91.039,312.70053,182.74599,323.70053],"origin":[91.039,321.20001],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Each item is rated on a 7-point scale, where 0 represents the complete absence of craving (e.g.,","bbox":[91.039,324.80054,558.75909,335.80054],"origin":[91.039,333.30002],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"'never thought about drinking', 'no urge') and 6 represents the most severe level (e.g., 'thought","bbox":[91.039,336.90054,548.5072,347.90054],"origin":[91.039,345.40002],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"about drinking nearly all of the time', 'would not be able to resist'). Response anchors vary","bbox":[91.039,349.00055,527.14508,360.00055],"origin":[91.039,357.50003],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"across items but follow the same severity progression. The PACS total score is the sum of all","bbox":[91.039,361.10056,543.42505,372.10056],"origin":[91.039,369.60004],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"five items, yielding a possible range of 0 to 30. Higher scores indicate greater alcohol craving.","bbox":[91.039,373.20056,545.90015,384.20056],"origin":[91.039,381.70004],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"### PACS Craving Severity Categories","bbox":[91.039,397.40057,282.38394,408.40057],"origin":[91.039,405.90005],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Descriptive severity labels are based on the response anchors' meanings at each score level","bbox":[91.039,409.50058,541.88513,420.50058],"origin":[91.039,418.00006],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"(i.e., what a typical respondent at that score would endorse across items). Based upon the","bbox":[91.039,421.60059,530.02704,432.60059],"origin":[91.039,430.10007],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"PACS total score, descriptive severity labels are (with Murphy et al.’s (2014) original descriptors","bbox":[91.039,433.70059,556.24005,444.70059],"origin":[91.039,442.20007],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"in brackets):","bbox":[91.039,445.8006,150.94498,456.8006],"origin":[91.039,454.30008],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"- 0–14: No/Minimal (Absent). Craving is absent or minimal. The average response falls in the","bbox":[91.039,470.00061,541.58801,481.00061],"origin":[91.039,478.50009],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"\"nonexistent\", \"slight\", or \"mild\" range across items.","bbox":[91.039,482.10062,340.66196,493.10062],"origin":[91.039,490.6001],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"- 15–20: Moderate (Subclinical). Craving is present at a moderate level. The average response","bbox":[91.039,494.20062,551.40009,505.20062],"origin":[91.039,502.7001],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"corresponds to \"moderate urge\" or \"moderately difficult\" to resist.","bbox":[91.039,506.30063,406.22198,517.30066],"origin":[91.039,514.80011],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"- 21–30: Elevated (Present). Craving is clearly present and potentially clinically significant. The","bbox":[91.039,518.4007,550.15692,529.4007],"origin":[91.039,526.90015],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"average response corresponds to \"strong urge\" or \"very difficult\" to resist.","bbox":[91.039,530.50067,447.802,541.50067],"origin":[91.039,539.00012],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"These categories are content-based interpretive guideposts derived from the response scale","bbox":[91.039,554.70068,540.41101,565.70068],"origin":[91.039,563.20013],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"semantics, not empirically validated diagnostic thresholds. They should be interpreted as","bbox":[91.039,566.80072,522.052,577.80072],"origin":[91.039,575.30017],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"describing the general level of craving severity rather than as clinical classifications. In clinical","bbox":[91.039,578.9007,545.86707,589.9007],"origin":[91.039,587.40015],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"practice, a score of 15 or above may warrant further attention to craving management, while","bbox":[91.039,591.00067,537.95813,602.00067],"origin":[91.039,599.50012],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"scores of 21 or above suggest craving at a level where the respondent reports strong urges and","bbox":[91.039,603.10071,556.32819,614.10071],"origin":[91.039,611.60016],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"significant difficulty resisting.","bbox":[91.039,615.20074,229.80397,626.20074],"origin":[91.039,623.7002],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"### PACS Percentile Context","bbox":[91.039,639.4007,235.32597,650.4007],"origin":[91.039,647.90015],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"To provide additional interpretive context, percentile rankings are derived from a treatment-","bbox":[91.039,651.50073,533.05206,662.50073],"origin":[91.039,660.00018],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"seeking heavy-drinking reference sample (Murphy et al., 2014). These percentiles indicate a","bbox":[91.039,663.60071,539.16803,674.60071],"origin":[91.039,672.10016],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"respondent's position relative to other treatment-seeking heavy drinkers. For example, a total","bbox":[91.039,675.70074,542.50104,686.70074],"origin":[91.039,684.2002],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"score of 15 corresponds to approximately the 26th percentile in the treatment-seeking sample,","bbox":[91.039,687.80072,548.96912,698.80072],"origin":[91.039,696.30017],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"indicating that roughly one-quarter of treatment-seeking heavy drinkers scored at or below this","bbox":[91.039,699.90076,548.95807,710.90076],"origin":[91.039,708.40021],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"level. A score of 21 corresponds to approximately the 63rd percentile.","bbox":[91.039,712.00073,429.13495,723.00073],"origin":[91.039,720.50018],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"### PACS Change Score Interpretation","bbox":[91.039,736.20074,283.63797,747.20074],"origin":[91.039,744.7002],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"The PACS is primarily intended for progress monitoring, and score changes across","bbox":[91.039,748.30072,494.51895,759.30072],"origin":[91.039,756.80017],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Page 2 of 4","bbox":[510.23599,809.92731,561.38611,819.92731],"origin":[510.23599,817.65411],"font":"Helvetica","size":10.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]}],"tables":[],"chartObservations":[]},{"pageId":"db6408f5477ed_p3","documentSha256":"b6408f5477ed6a44c86069e2a4108f2e09638d387b1b6e704b869b8636ec869d","pageNumber":3,"text":[{"text":"Client Name","bbox":[66.3844,116.32253,135.73239,128.32253],"origin":[66.3844,125.58502],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":12.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Generic Client","bbox":[147.73239,116.56485,217.41737,127.56485],"origin":[147.73239,125.06433],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"administrations provide clinically informative data about treatment response. A minimally","bbox":[91.0395,143.16556,520.18256,154.16556],"origin":[91.0395,151.66504],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"important difference (MID) of 3 points is used to evaluate whether a change in total score is","bbox":[91.0395,155.26553,534.29559,166.26553],"origin":[91.0395,163.76501],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"clinically meaningful. This threshold is derived by applying the widely used convention that a","bbox":[91.0395,167.36551,538.56348,178.36551],"origin":[91.0395,175.86499],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"meaningful change equals approximately half a standard deviation (Norman et al., 2003; Turner","bbox":[91.0395,179.46548,555.7016,190.46548],"origin":[91.0395,187.96497],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"et al., 2010), applied to the treatment-seeking sample SD of 5.99 (Murphy et al., 2014).","bbox":[91.0395,191.56546,513.52747,202.56546],"origin":[91.0395,200.06494],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"### PACS Graphs","bbox":[91.0395,215.76547,181.52547,226.76547],"origin":[91.0395,224.26495],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"On first administration, a bar chart displaying the PACS total score with craving severity shading","bbox":[91.0395,227.86545,557.49457,238.86545],"origin":[91.0395,236.36493],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"in the background is presented. Clinical percentiles (a treatment-seeking heavy drinking sample)","bbox":[91.0395,239.96542,559.33148,250.96542],"origin":[91.0395,248.4649],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"are shown on the right-hand side of the graph. A horizontal bar chart displays the PACS total","bbox":[91.0395,252.0654,541.65454,263.0654],"origin":[91.0395,260.56488],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"score in comparison to a non-treatment-seeking (heavy drinking) sample and a treatment-","bbox":[91.0395,264.16537,527.54144,275.16537],"origin":[91.0395,272.66486],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"seeking (heavy drinking) sample. Multiple administrations of the PACS will produce a line chart","bbox":[91.0395,276.26535,551.36749,287.26535],"origin":[91.0395,284.76483],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"plotting the raw total score over time, with background shading indicating the craving severity","bbox":[91.0395,288.36533,542.84247,299.36533],"origin":[91.0395,296.86481],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"categories.","bbox":[91.0395,300.4653,144.84048,311.4653],"origin":[91.0395,308.96478],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Client Responses","bbox":[34.3465,357.19684,151.8205,371.19684],"origin":[34.3465,368.00308],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1","bbox":[35.9047,381.49939,40.6307,389.99939],"origin":[35.9047,388.06717],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"During the past week how often have you thought about drinking or about how good a drink would make you feel?","bbox":[54.18905,381.49939,481.78201,389.99939],"origin":[54.18905,388.06717],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"0    Never (0 times during the past week)","bbox":[51.18909,399.07278,204.2486,407.57278],"origin":[51.18909,405.64056],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1    Rarely (1 to 2 times during the past week)","bbox":[51.18906,413.1037,222.67656,421.6037],"origin":[51.18906,419.67148],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"2    Occasionally (3 to 4 times during the past week)","bbox":[51.18906,427.2771,246.29808,435.7771],"origin":[51.18906,433.84488],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"3    Sometimes (5 to 10 times during the past week or 1 to 2 times per day)","bbox":[51.18906,441.57614,349.73477,450.07614],"origin":[51.18906,448.13708],"font":"Helvetica-BoldOblique","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"4    Often (11 to 20 times during the past week or 2 to 3 times per day)","bbox":[51.18906,455.6232,315.29269,464.1232],"origin":[51.18906,462.19098],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"5    Most of the time (20 to 40 times during the past week or 3 to 6 times per day)","bbox":[51.18906,469.7966,354.97079,478.2966],"origin":[51.18906,476.36438],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"6    Nearly all of the time (more than 40 times during the past week or more than 6 times per day)","bbox":[51.18909,483.82782,415.42294,492.32782],"origin":[51.18909,490.3956],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"2","bbox":[35.90469,501.40121,40.6307,509.90121],"origin":[35.90469,507.96899],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"At its most severe point, how strong was your craving during the past week?","bbox":[51.18906,501.40121,337.47772,509.90121],"origin":[51.18906,507.96899],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"0    None at all","bbox":[51.18909,518.97437,105.99709,527.47437],"origin":[51.18909,525.54211],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1    Slight, that is a very mild urge","bbox":[51.18906,533.00525,176.85306,541.50525],"origin":[51.18906,539.573],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"2    Mild urge","bbox":[51.18906,547.17859,100.31905,555.67865],"origin":[51.18906,553.7464],"f